WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:03.368
The partnership works as a connected system Daniel’s diary

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:08.276
work affects decisions documents and other people’s accepted assignments

00:00:09.197 --> 00:00:14.447
These interfaces are connected responsibilities not a universal hierarchy

00:00:15.329 --> 00:00:19.158
Finance and operations Finance and operations are responsible for

00:00:19.224 --> 00:00:23.908
their own papers and decisions Daniel coordinates their inputs

00:00:23.961 --> 00:00:27.026
and checks whether they are ready He does not

00:00:27.092 --> 00:00:30.710
approve specialist content simply because he assembles the meeting

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:35.157
pack Request identify the required owners obtain the separate

00:00:35.209 --> 00:00:38.986
decisions / acceptance update the controlled record check completion

00:00:39.025 --> 00:00:44.039
evidence Example dependency a business preference for a physical

00:00:44.053 --> 00:00:48.263
lunch does not by itself establish protective input transport

00:00:48.316 --> 00:00:53.737
arrangements or accepted monitoring Existing afternoon arrangements do not

00:00:53.842 --> 00:00:59.132
automatically cover the proposed lunch Workbook § 1 .

